        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository eb9793fd-4f4a-4181-aca9-b304beed659e).Image",
        "Description": "Know as the Whitewell Voyeur by his victims, this man has been known to prey on any woman that dares to attract his gaze whether that is voluntary or not. Although no crime is committed except for the cringe sent via his mobile device associates of his thing it best to just put him down for good before they begin to suffer guilt by association. \r\rBring no attention to yourself, but when they find him send a message so that others learn from his mistakes. Kill him before he drops another dm.",
